  "scope": "# Review \u2014 506e262f9354 parametric public-batch correction and qualification adapter\nTask/source: `506e262f9354` v3.0.0; production generator SHA-256 remains `762a30ac71d7bb9e779a6ce0948247878740259cac499842ef991e2863f20ec5`.\nDefect \u2192 repair: the prototype wrote public challenges while iterating private settings; it now precomputes and validates the complete visible batch, rejects duplicate visible IDs before any public write, and emits files in ID order.\nPromotion path: added a finite `expansion_direction = up | down` contract and adapter whose default program is byte-exact canonical Racket; protected qualification passed on both settings and two fresh seeds; separate owner acceptance was not invoked.\nChanged scope: task-local prototype, adapter/contract, focused tests, README, evidence manifest, and current task notes only.\nAuthority: canonical generator and selected Racket rule are unchanged; normalized canonical rule hash remains `d19e95f77d58`.\nNo production parametric acceptance or training admission is claimed. Finite settings/seeds and one declared rival do not prove universal identifiability.\n",
